ifferentiation from Wang et al. is 4-dimensional (quantitative convergence, per-example, scale, mechanistic)\n\n## Instructions\nWrite a detailed review with:\n1. Summary (2-3 sentences)\n2. Strengths (bulleted)\n3. Weaknesses (bulleted, with specific evidence)\n4. Questions for authors\n5. Missing related work or positioning issues\n6. Minor issues\n7. Scores: Soundness (1-5), Excitement (1-5), Reproducibility (1-5), Overall Assessment (1-5, half-point scale), Confidence (1-5)\n\nBe rigorous but fair. Calibrate to EMNLP 2026 standards. Pay special attention to whether the novelty is sufficient for Main vs Findings, and whether the paper adequately positions itself relative to Wang et al.","uuid":"9f1c8378-928e-4f23-bc01-50c91b3e239d","session_id":"d720358c-d2cd-4287-8c55-11bac61fdb11"}
