{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SttbXc7LmQqTDNSVi35E3a","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 entrainment_gated_ft 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (6 个)\\n\\n- **exp-003**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp-001**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-009**: DONE (success) — \\n- **eval_340m_retnet_hgrn2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **hgrn2_eval_h3_1**: DONE (success) — \\n- **hgrn2_eval_1_3b_all**: DONE (killed) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-19\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp-003** (negative): Architecture-specific helped/hurt samples on LAMBADA differ in surface features (token frequency, context length, lexical complexity), AND these feature profiles differ across GDN/HGRN2/RetNet — indicating architecture-specific mechanisms rather than generic attention benefit\\n  [sample_characterization_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/artifacts/exp-003/data/sample_characterization_results.csv) | [sample_characterization_figure](/api/workspace-files/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/artifacts/exp-003/chart/sample_characterization_figure_pointer.txt)\\n- **exp-001** (success): Cross-architecture variance (std) on retrieval-dependent tasks decreases monotonically with attention ratio at 1.3B scale, while reasoning-dependent tasks show no convergence — establishing task-specificity as a principled feature of the equalizer effect, not a limitation\\n  [task_specificity_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/artifacts/exp-001/data/task_specificity_results.csv) | [task_specificity_figure](/api/workspace-files/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/artifacts/exp-001/chart/task_specificity_figure_info.txt)\\n- **exp-009** (success): Our equalizer effect analysis provides fully novel contributions relative to Wang et al. (arXiv 2507.06457) across 4 dimensions: convergence quantification (Spearman ρ + permutation test vs qualitative observation), scale dependency (quantitative 1.3B vs 340M contrast vs binary statement), per-example mechanism (Jaccard + net effect analysis vs absent), and task-specificity (convergence-strength by task type vs ratio-sensitivity)\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 4 / 负向 1 / 失败 0 / 共 6\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestb-48145: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- hgrn2_eval_1_3b_all: 已被终止 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01QuP6ZtoKDoeeGojbELmH3Y","session_id":"d720358c-d2cd-4287-8c55-11bac61fdb11","uuid":"a242ee90-79de-425e-89fb-ac15364626f4","timestamp":"2026-05-19T13:49:39.050Z"}
