{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UZTLZDD8DHkrqGkNd4wVgv","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_2/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# entrainment_gated_ft — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-19 12:53 UTC | 更新原因: Post-MVP pivot: entrainment FAIL → equalizer effect story, EMNLP 2026 target, framing+plan 完成\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**Attention as Architectural Equalizer**: Attention 使不同 recurrent 架构在 retrieval-dependent tasks 上趋同（aggregate convergence），但 per-example 机制几乎完全不重叠（per-example divergence）。效应 scale-dependent（1.3B 完全 vs 340M 部分）。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Research 阶段** — Post-MVP pivot（原 entrainment 假设 FAIL，pivot to equalizer effect story）\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- MVP 完成：26 模型（16×1.3B + 10×340M）× 6 benchmarks 全面否定原始 entrainment 假设\\\\n- Equalizer effect 发现并定量刻画：LAMBADA cross-arch std 0.024→0.005（1.3B），ρ=-1.0\\\\n- Scale dependency 确认：1.3B 完全收敛，340M 部分收敛（rebound at attn=8）\\\\n- Per-example mechanism 揭示：Jaccard < 0.10，GDN net=-153 vs HGRN2 net=+153\\\\n- D004 confound（GDN h3-1 num_heads=16）通过 h6-1 robustness check 排除\\\\n- 三层证据链：aggregate convergence → scale dependency → per-example mechanism\\\\n- paper_framing.md 已写，experiment_plan.yaml 已写，等待 Dream 验证\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] Dream 模拟验证 plan（dream_simulate full review）\\\\n- [ ] exp-001: Cross-task convergence quantification（P0, analysis）\\\\n- [ ] exp-003: Helped/hurt sample characterization（P0, analysis）\\\\n- [ ] exp-009: Wang et al. explicit differentiation（P0, analysis）\\\\n- [ ] exp-008: Statistical robustness framework（P0, analysis）\\\\n- [ ] exp-010: Convergence-divergence bridge analysis（P0, analysis）\\\\n- [ ] exp-002: Multi-benchmark per-example analysis（P0, GPU ~8h）\\\\n- [ ] exp-006: 7B model evaluation（P0, GPU ~20h，先确认可用性）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配：westb-48145 cuda:0（RTX PRO 6000 × 1）\\\\n- 当前：空闲（等 Dream 通过后排实验）\\\\n- P0 GPU 实验预算：~29 GPU-hours（exp-002 8h + exp-006 20h + exp-003 1h）\\\\n- P1 GPU 实验预算：~10 GPU-hours（exp-004 4h + exp-005 6h）\\\\n- 总预算：~39 GPU-hours\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿目标\\\\n- EMNLP 2026 Main（via ARR June cycle，DDL ~June 15）\\\\n- Paper type: Empirical analysis\\\\n- 3 Core Claims: Equalizer Effect / Scale Dependency / Architecture-Specific Mechanism\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-19 | MVP 原始 entrainment 假设 FAIL，pivot to Equalizer Effe | eval_340m_retnet_hgrn2, hgrn2_eval_h3_1 |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-18 | GDN hybrid-3-1 存在 attn.num_heads confound（16 vs 32 | — |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-18 | 预注册 benchmark composition depth 赋值（结果出来前锁定，不可事后调整） | — |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-18 | 1.3B 也无 function composition ICL 能力，MVP 从 syntheti | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-18 | MVP Direct variant 340M 全模型 random-chance → 先跑 log | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2406, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01QuP6ZtoKDoeeGojbELmH3Y","session_id":"d720358c-d2cd-4287-8c55-11bac61fdb11","uuid":"20cbcd12-a9ab-494a-8f42-b69b8ec79421","timestamp":"2026-05-19T13:49:52.205Z"}
